---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	lang="en"
	title="About — František Bolgac"
	description="František Bolgac on technology, AI and data sovereignty."
>
	<article class="about-page">
		<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
		<h1>Technology, AI and data sovereignty without unnecessary ballast.</h1>
		<p class="lead">
			I am František Bolgac. I am interested in how technology, AI and data can be used in
			practice without losing control.
		</p>

		<div class="content">
			<h2>What interests me</h2>
			<p>
				I work with technological solutions that have a clear purpose and can be evaluated
				carefully. For me, it is important that technology helps people, keeps data under
				control and produces more than a demo nobody needs a month later.
			</p>

			<h2>How I write</h2>
			<p>
				On this blog I write about practical experience, evaluate tools and describe the
				limits of individual solutions. It is not only a list of tutorials, but also notes
				from working with technologies we want to use responsibly.
			</p>
		</div>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about-page {
		padding: 1rem 0;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	h1 {
		max-width: 24ch;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}
	.lead {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.125rem;
	}
	.content {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin-top: 3rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		padding-top: 2rem;
	}
	.content h2 {
		margin: 2rem 0 0;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}
	.content h2:first-child {
		margin-top: 0;
	}
	.content p {
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
</style>
